The original repository contained a single `harness` skill
(skills/harness/{SKILL.md, references/}). This plugin modifies and
extends it as follows:

  - Split into three skills:
      * team-harness     — domain analysis, 6 team-architecture patterns,
                           orchestrator design
      * flow-scaffolding — agent/command/skill/hook templates and generation
      * flow-validation  — 9 validation rulesets
  - Added commands: create-flow, verify-flow
  - Added docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
  - Korean localization and adaptation throughout

